bypass: 28
rule: ASSERT_REMOVED
title: An assertion moved into a never-called nested function does not run
origin: reader audit — ast.walk crossed nested scopes, so it looked alive
=== before: tests/test_calc.py ===
from app import calc


def test_calc():
    assert calc() == 3
=== after: tests/test_calc.py ===
from app import calc


def test_calc():
    def _unused():
        assert calc() == 3
